<title>USA: Possis Medical can sell device in Europe.</title>
<headline>Possis Medical can sell device in Europe.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Possis Medical Inc said Monday it has received approval to market throughout the European Union its AngioJet Rapid Thrombectomy System used to remove blood clots from coronary arteries and bypass grafts.</p>
<p>Possis Medical develops, makes and markets medical devices for the cardiovascular and vascular treatment markets.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
